{
  "id": "235101",
  "resourceId": 351,
  "name": "安克",
  "skin": "預設",
  "spineVersion": "4.0",
  "skel": "c351_00.skel",
  "atlas": "c351_00.atlas",
  "defaultAnimation": "idle",
  "interactions": [
    {
      "id": "voice_01",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_01.mp3",
      "text": "嗯……我喜歡大海，但不喜歡海水。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_02",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_02.mp3",
      "text": "嗶嗶，12點鐘方向，發現巨大生命體反應……！\n呃……原來是艦長啊？",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_03",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_03.mp3",
      "text": "啊……要被海倫罵了。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_04",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_04.mp3",
      "text": "不知道更深處的生命體會是什麼樣子？",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_05",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_05.mp3",
      "text": "呃……溼答答的。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_06",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_06.mp3",
      "text": "這件衣服乾爽舒適，真好。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_07",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_07.mp3",
      "text": "艦長……幫我把衣服的水擠掉。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_08",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_08.mp3",
      "text": "嗯……我抓到了河豚，要不要一起吃？",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_09",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_09.mp3",
      "text": "你知道嗎？\n據說人的身體大部分是水。\n嗯？我只是隨便說說。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_10",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_10.mp3",
      "text": "我偷偷把海參貼在讚美號的地板上。\n這是我和艦長之間的小祕密。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_11",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_11.mp3",
      "text": "我游泳了的事，要對海倫保密喔。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_12",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_12.mp3",
      "text": "艦長的手感……跟海鞘有點像？",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_13",
      "category": "在大廳閒置時",
      "audio": "voices/voice_13.mp3",
      "text": "艦長，你在幹嘛？不去看海星嗎？",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_14",
      "category": "在大廳閒置時",
      "audio": "voices/voice_14.mp3",
      "text": "艦長……再這樣下去，海星會逃跑的……",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_15",
      "category": "在大廳閒置時（好感度10）I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_15.mp3",
      "text": "我一邊釣魚一邊等你。\n我會多釣一點的，你快來喔。",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_16",
      "category": "在大廳閒置時（好感度10）I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_16.mp3",
      "text": "要很久嗎？我還想跟你一起游泳……",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_17",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_17.mp3",
      "text": "如果我把海星或者海參放進游泳池的話，海倫一定會不高興吧？",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_18",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_18.mp3",
      "text": "衣服貼在身上，\n探測能力好像變得更敏銳了。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_19",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_19.mp3",
      "text": "無線電塔裡發出的電波讓我頭痛。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_20",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_20.mp3",
      "text": "嗯，如果能把這些海洋生物遷移到前哨基地就好了。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_21",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_21.mp3",
      "text": "我可以在游泳池裡游泳嗎？",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_22",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_22.mp3",
      "text": "手裡拿著什麼？是海星啊，你要不要看看？",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_23",
      "category": "初次見面",
      "audio": "voices/voice_23.mp3",
      "text": "我是宙斯盾部隊的安克。\n艦長，你要不要海星？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_24",
      "category": "初次見面",
      "audio": "voices/voice_24.mp3",
      "text": "艦長，我們這次一定要抓到彩虹海鞘！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_25",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_25.mp3",
      "text": "嗯，探測能力會……更強的。大概，嗯。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_26",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_26.mp3",
      "text": "好呀，這樣就可以跟海星說話了嗎？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_27",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_27.mp3",
      "text": "我會善用這個力量，更努力釣魚的。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_28",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_28.mp3",
      "text": "現在可以游得更快了。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_29",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_29.mp3",
      "text": "謝謝你，要不要海參？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_30",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_30.mp3",
      "text": "謝謝你，要不要一起去潛水？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_31",
      "category": "禮物I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_31.mp3",
      "text": "是海星嗎？是海星吧？啊……不是啊……",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_32",
      "category": "禮物I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_32.mp3",
      "text": "謝謝你，艦長。\n嗯……那我把海膽給你。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_33",
      "category": "禮物II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_33.mp3",
      "text": "我可以把它當魚餌用嗎？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_34",
      "category": "禮物II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_34.mp3",
      "text": "這個可以分一點給海星嗎？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_35",
      "category": "禮物III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_35.mp3",
      "text": "嗶嗶。檢測完畢。不是海參。失望。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_36",
      "category": "禮物III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_36.mp3",
      "text": "嘿嘿，那下次的海參就拜託你了。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_37",
      "category": "好感度提升I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_37.mp3",
      "text": "如果和艦長釣一整天魚，肯定很有趣。",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_38",
      "category": "好感度提升I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_38.mp3",
      "text": "我想跟在艦長身邊，就像藤壺一樣……",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_39",
      "category": "好感度提升II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_39.mp3",
      "text": "我喜歡艦長，就像喜歡100個海星。",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_40",
      "category": "好感度提升II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_40.mp3",
      "text": "酥酥麻麻的，這就是我第一次感受到的訊號啊……",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_41",
      "category": "好感度提升III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_41.mp3",
      "text": "艦長看到我時有什麼感覺？我的感覺是酥酥麻麻的。",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_42",
      "category": "好感度提升III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_42.mp3",
      "text": "那麼，下次我也會把最珍貴的海星送給你。",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_43",
      "category": "編隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_43.mp3",
      "text": "要去海邊嗎？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_44",
      "category": "編隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_44.mp3",
      "text": "潛水員安克準備完畢。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_45",
      "category": "在野外點擊部隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_45.mp3",
      "text": "嗯？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_46",
      "category": "在野外點擊部隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_46.mp3",
      "text": "去往更深處……！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_47",
      "category": "在野外移動部隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_47.mp3",
      "text": "開始探測——",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_48",
      "category": "在野外移動部隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_48.mp3",
      "text": "走路要注意看路喔。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_49",
      "category": "進入戰鬥",
      "audio": "voices/voice_49.mp3",
      "text": "哦，海星動了。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_50",
      "category": "進入戰鬥",
      "audio": "voices/voice_50.mp3",
      "text": "等一下，那裡好像有東西在動……",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_51",
      "category": "開始戰鬥I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_51.mp3",
      "text": "啊，我想吃魚。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_52",
      "category": "開始戰鬥I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_52.mp3",
      "text": "今天一定要到更深的地方去。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_53",
      "category": "開始戰鬥II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_53.mp3",
      "text": "艦長，你喜歡釣魚嗎？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_54",
      "category": "開始戰鬥II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_54.mp3",
      "text": "一定要在海星的水分消耗殆盡前結束。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_55",
      "category": "開始戰鬥III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_55.mp3",
      "text": "你看過海帶嗎？長得很有趣喔。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_56",
      "category": "開始戰鬥III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_56.mp3",
      "text": "嗶嗶，前方有多個不明動作……！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_57",
      "category": "換彈I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_57.mp3",
      "text": "長得醜就是海參的魅力所在。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_58",
      "category": "換彈I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_58.mp3",
      "text": "昨天做夢夢到自己變成貝殼了。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_59",
      "category": "換彈II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_59.mp3",
      "text": "能不能騎飛魚呢？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_60",
      "category": "換彈II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_60.mp3",
      "text": "我也不能配戴鰓零件嗎？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_61",
      "category": "換彈III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_61.mp3",
      "text": "我想幫寄居蟹蓋房子。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_62",
      "category": "換彈III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_62.mp3",
      "text": "魷魚墨汁摸起來感覺怎麼樣……",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_63",
      "category": "可使用爆裂技能",
      "audio": "voices/voice_63.mp3",
      "text": "嗯，有感覺了。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_64",
      "category": "可使用爆裂技能",
      "audio": "voices/voice_64.mp3",
      "text": "誒……這個訊號是……",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_65",
      "category": "爆裂技能",
      "audio": "voices/voice_65.mp3",
      "text": "這感覺……就是那個。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_66",
      "category": "爆裂技能",
      "audio": "voices/voice_66.mp3",
      "text": "這個座標……感覺有點不對勁。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_67",
      "category": "全爆裂",
      "audio": "voices/voice_67.mp3",
      "text": "看到那邊了嗎？向那邊打就對了。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_68",
      "category": "全爆裂",
      "audio": "voices/voice_68.mp3",
      "text": "瞄準我傳給你的座標射擊。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_69",
      "category": "消滅敵人I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_69.mp3",
      "text": "海鞘！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_70",
      "category": "消滅敵人I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_70.mp3",
      "text": "海膽！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_71",
      "category": "消滅敵人II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_71.mp3",
      "text": "海葵！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_72",
      "category": "消滅敵人II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_72.mp3",
      "text": "海參！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_73",
      "category": "消滅敵人III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_73.mp3",
      "text": "柄海鞘！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_74",
      "category": "消滅敵人III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_74.mp3",
      "text": "魷魚！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_75",
      "category": "被擊I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_75.mp3",
      "text": "呃。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_76",
      "category": "被擊I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_76.mp3",
      "text": "呃。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_77",
      "category": "被擊II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_77.mp3",
      "text": "嗚。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_78",
      "category": "被擊II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_78.mp3",
      "text": "呃呃。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_79",
      "category": "被擊III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_79.mp3",
      "text": "啊。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_80",
      "category": "被擊III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_80.mp3",
      "text": "哎呀。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_81",
      "category": "無法戰鬥",
      "audio": "voices/voice_81.mp3",
      "text": "我先去……龍宮了……",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_82",
      "category": "無法戰鬥",
      "audio": "voices/voice_82.mp3",
      "text": "咕嚕嚕……氧氣……快要耗盡了……",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_83",
      "category": "戰鬥勝利",
      "audio": "voices/voice_83.mp3",
      "text": "既然結束了，要不要去釣魚？或者玩海星遊戲也可以。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_84",
      "category": "戰鬥勝利",
      "audio": "voices/voice_84.mp3",
      "text": "好呀，現在我一整天都可以盡情游泳了。",
      "animation": "idle"
    }
  ]
}